{"id": "swebq0116", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 2.51, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.3472, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "william averell harriman appointed by john fitzgerald kennedy", "query": "who did john kennedy have affairs with?", "transcript": "Who did John Kennedy have affairs with?", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "John F. Kennedy is reported to have had affairs or relationships with several women, though some claims are disputed. Notable names include Marilyn Monroe, Judith Campbell Exner, Mimi Alford, Mary Pinchot Meyer, Gunilla von Post, Inga Arvad, Pamela Turnure, and Marlene Dietrich. Many accounts come from memoirs, biographies, and later testimony, so the certainty varies by case.", "expert_answer": "John F. Kennedy is reported to have had affairs or relationships with several women, though some claims are disputed. Notable names include:\n\n- **Marilyn Monroe** — actress; widely alleged, not definitively proven.\n- **Judith Campbell Exner** — socialite, who claimed an affair with JFK.\n- **Mimi Alford** — White House intern, who later wrote about their affair.\n- **Mary Pinchot Meyer** — socialite and artist, often reported as a close relationship.\n- **Gunilla von Post** — Swedish aristocrat, who described a romance with JFK.\n- **Inga Arvad** — Danish journalist, linked to Kennedy before his presidency.\n- **Pamela Turnure** — Jacqueline Kennedy’s press secretary, alleged affair.\n- **Marlene Dietrich** — actress, who claimed a brief encounter.\n\nMany accounts come from memoirs, biographies, and later testimony, so the certainty varies by case.", "expert_latency_s": 9.31, "stall_ms": 23, "relay_ms": 2032}
{"id": "swebq0119", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 2.6, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2653, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "Semi-presidential system;Republic;Unitary state", "query": "what system of government does guyana have?", "transcript": "What system of government does Guyana have?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Guyana has a parliamentary representative democratic republic system of government.", "answer_ms": 268}
