{"id": "swebq0134", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.95, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2385, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Google Maps;Google Calendar;Google SketchUp;Google Docs and Spreadsheets;Blogger;Picasa;Google Talk;Google X;Gmail", "query": "what products and\\/or services does google offer customers?", "transcript": "What products and or services does Google offer customers?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Google offers a wide range of products and services to customers worldwide. These include the Google Search engine, which helps people find information on the internet. There's also Gmail for email communication, Google Maps for navigation and location services, and YouTube for video sharing. Google provides various productivity tools like Google Docs, Sheets, and Slides for creating and collaborating on documents. Additionally, they offer cloud storage with Google Drive, mobile operating systems like Android, and smart home devices such as Nest products. Google also has advertising platforms like Google Ads to help businesses reach their audiences online.", "answer_ms": 2701}
